# FRACTURE — Game Context untuk Cursor AI

## Tentang Game
Nama: FRACTURE
Genre: Top-down roguelite tactical action (Hotline Miami + Hades)
Engine: Three.js (vanilla JS, tidak pakai framework)
Platform: Web browser, no download, no login
Target: Menang Cursor Vibe Jam 2026 (deadline 1 Mei 2026)

## Core Mechanic
- One-hit kill: semua entitas (player dan musuh) mati dalam 1 hit
- Top-down camera dengan mouse aim
- Roguelite: tiap run beda, pilih Fragment ability tiap 3-4 room
- Room-by-room progression, boss tiap 5 room

## Struktur File
- main.js: init Three.js, game loop utama, state management
- src/player.js: movement, dash, shooting
- src/enemies.js: Watcher AI dan Charger AI
- src/room.js: room logic, door, clear condition
- src/roomGenerator.js: preset room pool
- src/fragments.js: 8 ability fragment system
- src/boss.js: boss 3 fase
- src/juice.js: screen shake, particles, hit flash
- src/audio.js: Howler.js wrapper
- src/ui.js: HUD, fragment picker, death screen
- src/collision.js: semua collision detection

## 2 Tipe Enemy
- Watcher: patrol + vision cone 90° + chase player
- Charger: idle → windup 0.6s → charge lurus kecepatan 18 → cooldown

## 8 Fragment Ability
GHOST_STEP, BLOOD_ECHO, SLOW_FIELD, PHASE_SHIFT,
VOID_PULL, CHAIN, VOID_SIGHT, FRACTURE_BURST

## Tech Stack
- Three.js: rendering 3D
- Howler.js: audio
- Vite: dev server dan build
- Vercel: hosting

## Aturan Penting
- WAJIB: <script async src="https://vibej.am/2026/widget.js"></script> ada di index.html
- Tidak boleh ada loading screen panjang
- Restart game dengan tombol R tanpa reload halaman
- 90% kode harus AI-generated (Vibe Jam rules)

## Visual Direction
- Warna dominan: hitam (#080810), ungu gelap (#3d1f78), merah (#ef4444)
- Low-poly 3D, lighting dramatis dengan PointLight berwarna
- Estetika: brutalist + liminal + surreal

## Game State
type GamePhase = 'start' | 'playing' | 'fragment' | 'dead' | 'boss' | 'win'

## Prinsip Development
- Satu sistem selesai dan bisa dimainkan sebelum mulai sistem berikutnya
- Polish (juice) lebih penting dari banyak fitur
- Scope ketat: selesaikan MUST HAVE sebelum NICE TO HAVE